      "value": "@{66e8856319e04e27049bc1c7|full_name}oh, i've just checked and as of build 1505 it does indeed not work on Quest either.\n\ni am quite certain however, that as of the time of writing it did.\n\nafter all, i turned on VRC there back then just to check it, and add that info to the post.\n\nalso, before i changed the sorting order to something else, it was working for me even today - it's simply that setting it back to 'last used' doesn't work anymore.",
