  "details": "steps:\n\n1. Open VRC\n\n2. open the quick or main menu\n\n3. open left or righ wing if needed\n\n4. set it to \"avatars\" if needed\n\n5. set any(?) avatars category/group, like \"recently used\" or \"uploaded\"\n\n6. if you have sort by \"recently used\" change it to something else\n\n7. set sort by to \"recently used\"\n\nwhat should happen:\n\navatars of that category will be sorted by last time of usage\n\nwhat actually happens:\n\navatars of that category are sorted by the previously chosen sorting method\n\nhappens in both live (build 1472) and beta (build 1487).\n\nposting in general bug reports because it's not a beta-specific regression\n\nhappens on PC, works fine on live Quest version",
